    "detailed_description": "TESD: Into The Vortex is an old school 2D pixel art style RPG game where players control a party consisting of Bryan Johnson, Walt Flanagan, and Brian Quinn. Players will fight enemies, complete quests, upgrade gear, and solve riddles. This game was developed as a solo project and total playtime should run a couple hours max.",
